    <h2>Research Topic & MeSH Keyword Analysis</h2>
    <p>All {len(df):,} records carry at least one MeSH major topic assignment. The most prevalent topics reflect a mix of persistent disease burdens (COVID-19, diabetes, Alzheimer's), oncology (breast neoplasms, hepatocellular carcinoma), and emerging methodological areas (gastrointestinal microbiome, microRNAs).</p>

