    <p>Cancer-related topics attract the largest teams. Breast Neoplasms shows a median of 10.0 authors, Gastrointestinal Microbiome 8.5, and Carcinoma, Hepatocellular 8.0. By contrast, Quality of Life studies and Coleoptera research cluster at 4.0 and 3.5 median authors, respectively — suggesting these domains rely more on small specialized groups than on large consortia.</p>
